Thread.Sleep(2000);
Assert.IsTrue(_email.WasNotificationSent(order.Id));
```

**Problem:** 2-second hard delay on every run. Non-deterministic — may still fail on slow CI, and always wastes time on fast machines. Contributes to flakiness (Camara et al., SAST 2021).

**Fix:** Use async/await with a proper completion signal:
```csharp
[TestMethod]
public async Task ProcessOrder_AsyncNotification_IsSent()
{
    var processor = new OrderProcessor(_db, _email, _inventory);
    var order = new Order { Items = { new OrderItem("SKU-1", 1) } };

    await processor.ProcessOrderAsync(order);

    Assert.IsTrue(_email.WasNotificationSent(order.Id));
}
```

